{"id":"fae50ce87c0c5e77","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl.md","title":"Substitution Lemma for GL","display":"thm-substitution-lemma-gl — Substitution Lemma for GL","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl","aliases":["89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl"],"display":"thm-substitution-lemma-gl — Substitution Lemma for GL","depends_on":["[[89-df-substitution-modal]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-substitution-lemma-gl — Substitution Lemma for GL"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"48f7a8aeae4eecb4\" href=\"?note=48f7a8aeae4eecb4\" title=\"89-df-substitution-modal\">89-df-substitution-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[p:=B]\">\\(A[p:=B]\\)</span> is capture-free modal substitution.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}lemma\\text{-}gl}\\vdash\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longrightarrow\nA[p:=B]\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}lemma\\text{-}gl}\\vdash\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longrightarrow\nA[p:=B]\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> : GL逻辑 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[p:=B]\">\\(A[p:=B]\\)</span> : 代入结果 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"48f7a8aeae4eecb4\" href=\"?note=48f7a8aeae4eecb4\" title=\"89-df-substitution-modal\">89-df-substitution-modal</a>)</li>\n<li>GL满足代入封闭性</li>\n<li>正态模态逻辑的基本性质</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-substitution-modal","status":"resolved","id":"48f7a8aeae4eecb4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-substitution-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GL}$ : GL逻辑 (see [[89-df-gl-logic]])","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-substitution-modal","status":"resolved","id":"48f7a8aeae4eecb4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$A[p:=B]$ : 代入结果 (see [[89-df-substitution-modal]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"A[p:=B]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}lemma\\text{-}gl}\\vdash\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longrightarrow\nA[p:=B]\\in\\mathrm{GL}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"A[p:=B]","display":false}],"bytes":860,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-151","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-thm-arithmetical-completeness-full.md]]\n[[89-thm-arithmetical-completeness.md]]\n[[89-thm-canonical-model-gl.md]]\n[[89-thm-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[89-thm-fixed-point-theorem.md]]\n[[89-thm-fmp-gl.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-completeness-arithmetical.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-completeness-kripke.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-completeness.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-decidability.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-decidable.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-soundness.md]]\n[[89-thm-godel-translation.md]]\n[[89-thm-henkin-provable.md]]\n[[89-thm-lob-theorem.md]]\n[[89-thm-normalization.md]]\n[[89-thm-solovay-theorem.md]]\n[[89-thm-solovay.md]]\n[[89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl.md]]"}],"outgoing":["48f7a8aeae4eecb4","0006800fa1c85177"]}